# Benchmark run outputs — regenerated by run_benchmark.py / score.py on every run.
# Kept out of version control so a rerun never shows up as a diff. The frozen
# *_published.* snapshots behind the numbers on the Overview page are NOT listed here,
# and so stay tracked.
results.jsonl
labels_to_fill.csv
score_results.txt

# The repo-root .gitignore has a blanket `**/*.tsv` (for the large graph TSVs), which
# would silently drop the human-readable gold-standard table. It is 449 bytes and is the
# eyeball-able form of the evidence behind the published panel scores, so re-include it.
!gold_gene_panel.tsv
